<title>SINGAPORE: UOB Bank takes over OSK Asset Mangement.</title>
<headline>UOB Bank takes over OSK Asset Mangement.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Overseas Bank Ltd said on Wednesday UOB Asset Management Ltd has completed the purchase of a 70 percent stake in O.S.K Asset Management Bhd.</p>
<p>The purchase of 1.4 million shares at par value was for a total cash consideration of 1.4 million ringgit, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>O.S.K. Asset Management would change its name to UOB-OSK Asset Management Sdn Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
